WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.698
You keep writing Task 2 essays without knowing which

00:00:03.698 --> 00:00:05.050
problem to fix first.

00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:07.925
Send one Task 2 essay.

00:00:07.925 --> 00:00:11.507
Mr. Jay or his team reads it by hand and sends back one

00:00:11.507 --> 00:00:14.437
strength to keep and three priorities to fix.

00:00:15.446 --> 00:00:18.846
It's for teens and adults preparing for IELTS Writing.

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:22.075
79,000 dong Basic.

00:00:22.075 --> 00:00:25.175
See the sample, or message Mr. Jay on Zalo.

